      "stepByStep": "1. $\\text{Area}_1 = 0.5 \\times 4 \\times 10 = +20\\text{ J}$.\n2. $\\text{Area}_2 = 0.5 \\times 2 \\times 6 = 6\\text{ J}$.\n3. Total work $W = 20 - 6 = 14\\text{ J}$.",
      "finalAnswer": "Option A: 14 J",
